  "lessons": [
    {
      "file": "course-app/content/hsk2/lesson-13.json",
      "sha256": "06d5d9e3f096ffe189f8d8214ba5582db9912e776e9ce3cee55d4fbd928057e1",
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13",
      "source": {
        "startPdfPage": 127,
        "endPdfPage": 135,
        "startPrintedPage": 112,
        "endPrintedPage": 120
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text1",
          "audioTrack": "13-1",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text1:line1",
              "zh": "时间过得真快啊！新年就要到了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 128,
                "printedPage": 113,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text1:line2",
              "zh": "这一年王老师教我们中文，每天工作都很累。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 128,
                "printedPage": 113,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text1:line3",
              "zh": "是啊，她教得很好。因为她，我们都非常爱上中文课。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 128,
                "printedPage": 113,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text1:line4",
              "zh": "我们给她准备个新年礼物吧。你觉得送给她什么好呢？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 128,
                "printedPage": 113,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text1:line5",
              "zh": "王老师喜欢花，就送给她花吧。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 128,
                "printedPage": 113,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text1:line6",
              "zh": "那我们去花店看看，现在买花的人多，希望花店还有漂亮的花。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 128,
                "printedPage": 113,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text2",
          "audioTrack": "13-3",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text2:line1",
              "zh": "王老师，今天的词比昨天多了十个。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 130,
                "printedPage": 115,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text2:line2",
              "zh": "是啊！你们都学会了吗？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 130,
                "printedPage": 115,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text2:line3",
              "zh": "学会了，没有问题。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 130,
                "printedPage": 115,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text2:line4",
              "zh": "好。现在我来说，你们在本子上面写。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 130,
                "printedPage": 115,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text2:line5",
              "zh": "……",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 130,
                "printedPage": 115,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text2:line6",
              "zh": "同学们，“洗手间”的“间”字写错了，它的里面是“日”，不是“口”。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 130,
                "printedPage": 115,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text2:line7",
              "zh": "“日”比“口”多一笔，写“口”就是“问题”的“问”了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 130,
                "printedPage": 115,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text2:line8",
              "zh": "没错，你说得很对。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 130,
                "printedPage": 115,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text3",
          "audioTrack": "13-5",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text3:line1",
              "zh": "家月，你觉得这个本子怎么样？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 132,
                "printedPage": 117,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text3:line2",
              "zh": "很漂亮，多少钱一个？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 132,
                "printedPage": 117,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text3:line3",
              "zh": "比我们一起买的那个本子贵一点儿。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 132,
                "printedPage": 117,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text3:line4",
              "zh": "这么漂亮的本子，不可能贵一点儿吧？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 132,
                "printedPage": 117,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text3:line5",
              "zh": "我是上网买的，真没那么贵。我买了两个，送你一个。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 132,
                "printedPage": 117,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text3:line6",
              "zh": "谢谢！那我送给你什么呢？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 132,
                "printedPage": 117,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text3:line7",
              "zh": "咖啡杯吧，我最喜欢喝咖啡了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 132,
                "printedPage": 117,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text3:line8",
              "zh": "好，那样我们就都有新年礼物了！",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 132,
                "printedPage": 117,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text4",
          "audioTrack": "13-7",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l13:text4:line1",
              "zh": "新年就要到了，安妮送给我一个新本子。她告诉我是在网上买的，比我的本子贵一点儿。我们班同学也送了王老师漂亮的花，希望她高高兴兴地过个新年。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 134,
                "printedPage": 119,
                "section": "课文4",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
