    {
      "file": "course-app/content/hsk2/lesson-14.json",
      "sha256": "74d7a43cbed89ddf152a840d3c5bc06e8200c975fa1de5e9bf4223e227d52e0f",
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14",
      "source": {
        "startPdfPage": 136,
        "endPdfPage": 144,
        "startPrintedPage": 121,
        "endPrintedPage": 129
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text1",
          "audioTrack": "14-1",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text1:line1",
              "zh": "王老师，你家楼下站着一个人。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 137,
                "printedPage": 122,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text1:line2",
              "zh": "我家楼下？我看看。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 137,
                "printedPage": 122,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text1:line3",
              "zh": "那个人穿着黑色的裤子，手里还拿着一个黑色的包。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 137,
                "printedPage": 122,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text1:line4",
              "zh": "我看见那个人了，他是我男朋友。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 137,
                "printedPage": 122,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text1:line5",
              "zh": "那我们快过去吧。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 137,
                "printedPage": 122,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text2",
          "audioTrack": "14-3",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text2:line1",
              "zh": "同乐，真是你啊！上次打电话，你说有时间过来看我，没想到这么快就来了！",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 139,
                "printedPage": 124,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text2:line2",
              "zh": "就要过年了，你一个人在这儿多没意思啊，所以我就早早过来了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 139,
                "printedPage": 124,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text2:line3",
              "zh": "你能来，我太高兴了！",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 139,
                "printedPage": 124,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text2:line4",
              "zh": "一飞，你旁边这位是？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 139,
                "printedPage": 124,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text2:line5",
              "zh": "同乐，这是李文，他在我们学校学医。李文，这是我男朋友杨同乐。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 139,
                "printedPage": 124,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text2:line6",
              "zh": "李文，很高兴认识你！",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 139,
                "printedPage": 124,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text2:line7",
              "zh": "认识你我也很高兴！我家就在前面那个楼，有时间来玩。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 139,
                "printedPage": 124,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text3",
          "audioTrack": "14-5",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text3:line1",
              "zh": "一飞，你住的房子真不错，很大，离学校也不远。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 141,
                "printedPage": 126,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text3:line2",
              "zh": "是啊！我楼下还住着一家中国人，他们人很好。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 141,
                "printedPage": 126,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text3:line3",
              "zh": "这样你有事情就可以找他们帮忙。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 141,
                "printedPage": 126,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text3:line4",
              "zh": "对，我也帮他们家的小孩儿学中文。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 141,
                "printedPage": 126,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text3:line5",
              "zh": "我记得你跟我说过，是个女孩儿，学得也很好。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 141,
                "printedPage": 126,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text3:line6",
              "zh": "没错，她经常跑上来找我玩。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 141,
                "printedPage": 126,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text3:line7",
              "zh": "你问问他们什么时候有时间，我请他们吃个饭。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 141,
                "printedPage": 126,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text4",
          "audioTrack": "14-7",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l14:text4:line1",
              "zh": "我男朋友姓杨，叫杨同乐。他高个子、大眼睛，唱歌唱得很好，跳舞跳得也不错。他和我姐姐一起工作，是姐姐介绍我们认识的。他告诉我，从见到我的第一天开始，他就喜欢上我了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 143,
                "printedPage": 128,
                "section": "课文4",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
