    {
      "file": "course-app/content/hsk2/lesson-15.json",
      "sha256": "299a8d8cf8f90e721d8a8c8b0ca24d7c33d759949166cab1edd2eeddf00ae907",
      "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15",
      "source": {
        "startPdfPage": 145,
        "endPdfPage": 155,
        "startPrintedPage": 130,
        "endPrintedPage": 140
      },
      "texts": [
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text1",
          "audioTrack": "15-1",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text1:line1",
              "zh": "考试就要开始了，请大家写上姓名，写好后就可以做题了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 146,
                "printedPage": 131,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text1:line2",
              "zh": "……",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 146,
                "printedPage": 131,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text1:line3",
              "zh": "老师，我做完了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 146,
                "printedPage": 131,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text1:line4",
              "zh": "老师，我也做完了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 146,
                "printedPage": 131,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text1:line5",
              "zh": "……对了，你们考完试想做什么？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 146,
                "printedPage": 131,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text1:line6",
              "zh": "我很想去中国，虽然去过一次，但是很想再去一次。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 146,
                "printedPage": 131,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text1:line7",
              "zh": "不错，到中国后你就可以经常说中文了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 146,
                "printedPage": 131,
                "section": "课文1",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text2",
          "audioTrack": "15-3",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text2:line1",
              "zh": "考完试了，我现在可以出国旅游了。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 148,
                "printedPage": 133,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text2:line2",
              "zh": "你要去哪儿？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 148,
                "printedPage": 133,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text2:line3",
              "zh": "我要再去一次北京。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 148,
                "printedPage": 133,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text2:line4",
              "zh": "为什么还去北京？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 148,
                "printedPage": 133,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text2:line5",
              "zh": "因为我想再吃一次烤鸭，再喝一次奶茶，再去北京大学看一次电影……",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 148,
                "printedPage": 133,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text2:line6",
              "zh": "你想做的事情很多啊！",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 148,
                "printedPage": 133,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text2:line7",
              "zh": "是啊，你看，我还在网上买好颐和园的门票了呢。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 148,
                "printedPage": 133,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text2:line8",
              "zh": "我的高中同学就在颐和园上班，可以让他给你好好介绍介绍。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 148,
                "printedPage": 133,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text2:line9",
              "zh": "太好了！出门旅游，多个朋友多条路。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 148,
                "printedPage": 133,
                "section": "课文2",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text3",
          "audioTrack": "15-5",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text3:line1",
              "zh": "李文，你有一年没回国了吧？",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 150,
                "printedPage": 135,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text3:line2",
              "zh": "不到一年。我六月的时候回去了一次。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 150,
                "printedPage": 135,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text3:line3",
              "zh": "我怎么忘了？还是我送你去的机场呢。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 150,
                "printedPage": 135,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text3:line4",
              "zh": "是啊。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 150,
                "printedPage": 135,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text3:line5",
              "zh": "我记得你那次的机票很便宜。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 150,
                "printedPage": 135,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text3:line6",
              "zh": "没错，可能因为那个时候去北京的人不多吧。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 150,
                "printedPage": 135,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text3:line7",
              "zh": "这次的机票虽然有点儿贵，但想到就要飞北京了，我还是很高兴的。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 150,
                "printedPage": 135,
                "section": "课文3",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text4",
          "audioTrack": "15-7",
          "lines": [
            {
              "id": "hsk2-fltrp-2026:l15:text4:line1",
              "zh": "我六月的时候回过一次北京，现在有半年多没回去了，我有点儿想家。就要过年了，我要回家过年。家月这次也要去北京，我们都是星期五的飞机。家月说我们好像小鸟，一起飞到北京，再一起飞回这里。",
              "source": {
                "pdfPage": 151,
                "printedPage": 136,
                "section": "课文4",
                "provenance": "textbook"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
